      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Eleonora storms into the kitchen furious that she was kept waiting in her own restaurant while the cooks drank coffee. She fines the entire staff a day's pay, and then greets philanthropist Alyokhin, who wants to nap before discussing the loan.",
      "gap": 0.8
